1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:15,009
All five situations from lessons 11–15 — three options each and a full model dialogue with the examiner. Plus twelve phrases that work in any situation and five mistakes that cost people points. Get ready and speak out loud!

2
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:33,109
How does task 4 work? The examiner describes a situation and shows three options. You suggest one. She usually says she doesn’t like it — and you suggest another. In the end you agree and say why. You can get seven points for this task.

3
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:50,608
The dialogue has a simple plan. You suggest one option. The examiner says why not. You calmly suggest another. And when she asks why, you answer: protože. Now let’s go through all five situations. Speak yourself first, then you hear the model.

4
00:00:51,967 --> 00:00:56,745
Situation 11: We want to go to an event together on Friday evening.

5
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:05,256
Let's go out together on Friday evening. Where shall we go? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

6
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,883
We could go to a football match.

7
00:01:20,333 --> 00:01:21,768
I don't enjoy football.

8
00:01:22,233 --> 00:01:23,798
Then let's go to a concert.

9
00:01:24,233 --> 00:01:25,720
The concert is sold out.

10
00:01:26,167 --> 00:01:27,653
Then let's go bowling.

11
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:29,665
And why there?

12
00:01:30,100 --> 00:01:32,971
Because it's fun and we can bring our friends too.

13
00:01:33,433 --> 00:01:34,920
OK, let's go bowling.

14
00:01:35,367 --> 00:01:40,145
Situation 12: We want to adopt a pet from a shelter for the kids.

15
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:49,806
Let's adopt an animal from the shelter for the kids. Which animal shall we take? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

16
00:02:02,467 --> 00:02:04,032
We could take a dog.

17
00:02:04,467 --> 00:02:06,319
A dog needs a lot of space.

18
00:02:06,767 --> 00:02:08,306
Then let's take a cat.

19
00:02:08,767 --> 00:02:10,253
I'm allergic to cats.

20
00:02:10,700 --> 00:02:12,317
Then let's take a rabbit.

21
00:02:12,767 --> 00:02:14,384
And why do you want this animal?

22
00:02:14,833 --> 00:02:17,940
Because it's small, quiet and the kids will love it.

23
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,958
You're right. Let's take the rabbit.

24
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:26,648
Situation 13: We want to buy a present for a colleague who is leaving.

25
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:37,089
Let's buy a present together for a colleague who is leaving the job. What shall we get her? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

26
00:02:49,733 --> 00:02:51,586
We could buy her a coffee machine.

27
00:02:52,033 --> 00:02:53,598
A coffee machine is too expensive.

28
00:02:54,033 --> 00:02:55,703
Then let's buy her a bouquet.

29
00:02:56,167 --> 00:02:57,732
A bouquet will wilt quickly.

30
00:02:58,167 --> 00:03:00,254
Then let's buy her a wellness voucher.

31
00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:02,370
And why do you want to buy that?

32
00:03:02,833 --> 00:03:05,809
Because she worked hard and now she can relax.

33
00:03:06,267 --> 00:03:09,504
That's a good idea. Let's buy her a wellness voucher.

34
00:03:09,967 --> 00:03:14,327
Situation 14: We want to go away together for the weekend.

35
00:03:15,067 --> 00:03:22,953
Let's go away from the city together for the weekend. Where shall we go? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

36
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:37,087
We could go camping.

37
00:03:37,533 --> 00:03:39,020
There are too many people at the campsite.

38
00:03:39,467 --> 00:03:41,450
Then let's go to a hotel in town.

39
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:43,282
The hotel is too expensive.

40
00:03:43,733 --> 00:03:45,272
Then let's go to a cottage.

41
00:03:45,733 --> 00:03:47,220
And why do you want to go there?

42
00:03:47,667 --> 00:03:50,224
Because it's quiet there and we can have a barbecue.

43
00:03:50,667 --> 00:03:52,206
OK, let's go to the cottage.

44
00:03:52,667 --> 00:03:56,060
Situation 15: We want to go on a trip together.

45
00:03:56,800 --> 00:04:03,720
Let's go on a trip together. How shall we travel? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

46
00:04:16,367 --> 00:04:17,853
We could go by car.

47
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:19,734
The car is at the garage.

48
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,870
Then let's take the bus.

49
00:04:22,333 --> 00:04:23,768
The bus takes too long.

50
00:04:24,233 --> 00:04:25,772
Then let's take the train.

51
00:04:26,233 --> 00:04:27,668
And why do you want to go that way?

52
00:04:28,133 --> 00:04:30,822
Because it's fast and we can read on the train.

53
00:04:31,267 --> 00:04:33,772
You're right. Let's take the train.

54
00:04:34,233 --> 00:04:39,847
Now twelve phrases to reach agreement in any situation. Listen and repeat out loud.

55
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,434
We could go to the cinema.

56
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:47,326
What if we went to the mountains?

57
00:04:50,967 --> 00:04:52,062
How about pizza?

58
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:57,448
Then let's go to a restaurant.

59
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:02,900
OK, then we’ll cook goulash.

60
00:05:06,567 --> 00:05:08,733
You’re right, the theatre is expensive.

61
00:05:12,367 --> 00:05:13,775
That’s a pity, but never mind.

62
00:05:17,433 --> 00:05:18,920
I’d rather go to the seaside.

63
00:05:22,567 --> 00:05:23,923
Because swimming is healthy.

64
00:05:27,567 --> 00:05:29,210
The cinema is cheap and close.

65
00:05:32,867 --> 00:05:35,268
I agree, that’s a good idea.

66
00:05:38,933 --> 00:05:39,950
It’ll be fun.

67
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:46,445
Five typical mistakes that cost people points.

68
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:57,334
Correct: Co kdybychom šli do kina? Make suggestions in full sentences: Můžeme…, Co kdybychom…

69
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:08,525
Correct: Dobře, tak půjdeme do divadla. When the examiner disagrees, suggest another option.

70
00:06:12,667 --> 00:06:19,717
Correct: Protože plavání je zdravé a bazén je blízko. At the end give a concrete reason: protože…

71
00:06:23,867 --> 00:06:32,093
Correct: Chceš jet na hory? In task 4 you talk to a friend: use the informal “ty” — máš, chceš, můžeš.

72
00:06:36,233 --> 00:06:43,180
Correct: Půjdeme do kina. After do use the genitive: do kina, do divadla, do restaurace.

73
00:06:44,833 --> 00:07:02,542
Summary. First: make suggestions in full sentences. Second: when the examiner disagrees, suggest another option. Third: at the end give a reason — protože. And fourth: with a friend you use “ty”.

74
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:17,990
What about you? Which situation in today's video is the hardest for you? Write in the comments, in a full sentence, what you would suggest and why. And if the video helps you, subscribe — there's a new video every day.

75
00:07:19,633 --> 00:07:35,723
